sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant GUI as Tkinter GUI
    participant Cam as Webcam/OpenCV
    participant Model as LBPH Model
    participant DB as SQLite Database
    Admin->>GUI: Click Take Attendance
    GUI->>Model: Load trainer.yml
    GUI->>Cam: Open camera
    loop Each frame
        Cam->>Cam: Detect face with Haar Cascade
        Cam->>Model: Predict label and distance
        Model-->>Cam: Student database ID, confidence distance
        Cam->>DB: Look up student
        alt Known face and not marked today
            DB-->>Cam: Student record
            Cam->>DB: Insert Present record
            DB-->>GUI: Attendance marked
        else Unknown or already marked
            DB-->>GUI: Display status only
        end
    end
    Admin->>Cam: Press Q / Esc
    Cam-->>GUI: Release camera and close window
